<newsitem itemid="274350" id="root" date="1996-12-23" xml:lang="en">
<title>HONG KONG: Ming Pao posts HK$18.5 mln interim loss.</title>
<headline>Ming Pao posts HK$18.5 mln interim loss.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	 4.7 loss   vs 15.1 gain</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)  nil	  vs 3.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	6.04 loss  vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			  18.53 loss vs 53.96 profit</p>
<p>    Turnover		   672.11     vs 672.57</p>
<p>    Company name	     Ming Pao Enterprise Corporation Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	 N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Ming Pao engages in newspaper, magazine and book publishing in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>Exceptional represents compensation paid to third parties and the provision of related legal costs incurred in connection with a claim brought against a subsidiary company by third parties in respect of an alleged defamatory acticle published in the June 2 edition of the Yazhou Zhoukan magazine.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
